{"displayStem":"28세 남자가 다뇨와 갈증 때문에 병원에 왔다. 고혈당, 고칼슘혈증과 저칼륨혈증은 없고 신기능은 보존되어 있다. 의료진의 감시 아래 제한된 수분제한 평가를 시행하고 종료 시점에 데스모프레신(DDAVP)을 투여하였다. 중단 기준과 안전 관찰은 별도로 적용하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>소변 농축 반응</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"소변 농축 반응。관찰 시간 (h)、소변 삼투질농도 (mOsm/kg)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">소변 삼투질농도 (mOsm/kg)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.25</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3.75</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">225</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">450</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">675</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">900</text><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></line><text x=\"340\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DDAVP</text><polyline points=\"76,200.38666666666666 164,197.87333333333333 252,198.84 340,195.74666666666667 384,146.25333333333333 428,106.04 516,93.47333333333333\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"200.38666666666666\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"197.87333333333333\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"198.84\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"195.74666666666667\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"384\" cy=\"146.25333333333333\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"106.04\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"93.47333333333333\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">환자</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">관찰 시간 (h)</text></svg></figure><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>혈장 변화</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"혈장 변화。관찰 시간 (h)、혈장 삼투질농도 (mOsm/kg)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">혈장 삼투질농도 (mOsm/kg)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"blac