(h)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>평소 소변량</td><td>5.4L/일</td></tr><tr><td>투여 직전 소변량</td><td>280mL/h</td></tr><tr><td>투여 후 소변량</td><td>62mL/h</td></tr><tr><td>약물력</td><td>리튬 복용 없음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}